{"comments":"AudioEffect — Composable Audio Effect Pipeline\n\nParallel to RenderEffect for visual, AudioEffect provides a composable\nADT for audio processing. Effects are pure data describing audio\ntransformations. The audio runtime interprets them.\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nAudioEffect\n    ↓ interpreted by\nAudioRuntime (Web Audio API, native, etc.)\n    ↓ produces\nProcessed Audio\n```\n\n## Composition\n\nEffects compose via:\n- `EffectSequence` — Apply in series (input → effect1 → effect2 → output)\n- `EffectParallel` — Apply in parallel and mix\n- `EffectConditional` — Apply based on condition\n- `EffectAnimated` — Crossfade between effect states\n\n## Reference\nCouncil gap: COUNCIL_REVIEW.md §3.6 \"RenderEffect.purs is visual-only\"\n","declarations":[{"children":[{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Hydrogen","Schema","Audio","Effects"],"Reverb"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"}],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[71,17],"name":"../src/Hydrogen/Audio/AudioEffect.purs","start":[71,3]},"title":"EffectReverb"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Hydrogen","Schema","Audio","Effects"],"Delay"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"}],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[72,16],"name":"../src/Hydrogen/Audio/AudioEffect.purs","start":[72,3]},"title":"EffectDelay"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Hydrogen","Schema","Audio","Effects"],"Compressor"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"}],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[73,21],"name":"../src/Hydrogen/Audio/AudioEffect.purs","start":[73,3]},"title":"EffectCompressor"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Hydrogen","Schema","Audio","Effects"],"EQ"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"}],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[74,13],"name":"../src/Hydrogen/Audio/AudioEffect.purs","start":[74,3]},"title":"EffectEQ"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[{"annotation":[],"con